  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/PorratCarrerPortalValencia.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(18 fotos) El carrer Portal de Val&egrave;ncia a Onda ha iniciat la nit d&#39;aquest divendres les festes, que s&#39;extendran fins diumenge 10 de setembre amb quatre dies de bous i vaques de les ramaderies&#39;El Mijares&#39; i Zorilla, i d&#39;altres actes.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17porrat/img_4514.jpg\" alt=\"img_4514\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17porrat/img_4515.jpg\" alt=\"img_4515\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17porrat/img_4519.jpg\" alt=\"img_4519\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17porrat/img_4522.jpg\" alt=\"img_4522\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17porrat/img_4525.jpg\" alt=\"img_4525\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17porrat/img_4529.jpg\" alt=\"img_4529\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17porrat/img_4534.jpg\" alt=\"img_4534\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17porrat/img_4536.jpg\" alt=\"img_4536\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17porrat/img_4538.jpg\" alt=\"img_4538\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d